https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974466_2078471318983882_98333641966260853_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jm0VRvqrVv0Q7kNvwGj8Y_W&_nc_oc=AdlrJtRWITFC5pTX0qMnsZWhhedL-tARiw8iSireSSAxJCktSm1zSAzeqqK6266ro1Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afs5prTdkTTnnS4XYzOxKPdqB8iXkE8RO3N2xG8nLKasJw&oe=69A41A0F"}, "display_name": "Blockies VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Blockies VR is a single player action-puzzle game where you knock down block buildings and protect friendly Blockies against the forces of evil. Launch a wide range of objects at enemies in this low-poly physics world. Travel to the Kingdom\u2019s shop to expand your weapon arsenal to take on the most difficult puzzles in all the land.\n\nFeatures\n-A dozen types of blocks that interact uniquely with the world\n-A dozen AI enemy types each with their own abilities\n-Levels where you must defend the Blockies from monster attacks\n-Levels with intricate block puzzles to solve\n-The Kingdom where cool new projectiles can be purchased\n-Beautifully designed low poly environments\n-At least 50 levels by full release (Currently 16)\n-With enough support: Level Editor to create and share new levels\n-With enough support: Co-op and Multiplayer Functionality\n\nJoin the Discord to learn more about future updates, and provide your own feedback of what you want in the game!", "short_description": "Blockies VR is a fast-paced, action-puzzle game where you throw projectiles. Destroy block buildings and defend friendly Blockies! Fight against all kinds of enemy monsters by throwing projectiles ranging from a silly pineapple to a destructive blackhole."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://dragongatestudio.net/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "DragonGate Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://dragongatestudio.net/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", 